[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0019","text":"班主任"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0020","text":"这次是难度相当高的模拟考试，\n所以只推荐给了部分学生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0030","text":"虽然前几天刚考过另一场模拟考，\n但这边这场我也希望你能务必参加——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0040","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0050","text":"不好意思，我是幽谷，\n周末已经有别的事情了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0060","text":"如果可以的话，只有幽谷……是的……\n能不能不参加……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0070","text":"拜托您了！？\n谢谢您！麻烦您了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0080","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0090","text":"哦，雾子！\n听我说，有个特别好的工作邀约！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0100","text":"内容我觉得也很适合雾子，\n虽然时间稍微靠后一点，这个日程……你觉得怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0110","text":"好的……\n嗯，那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0120","text":"啊………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0130","text":"这一天……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0140","text":"希望你能务必参加——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0150","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0160","text":"P、Producer先生……\n那、那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0170","text":"啊————…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0180","text":"对、对不起……\n我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0190","text":"马上……收拾好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0200","text":"哦、哦，我也来帮忙"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0210","text":"────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0220","text":"……\n……雾子？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0230","text":"其实，幽谷同学还没有报名模拟考试\n我在想，是不是因为工作安排有冲突……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0240","text":"这一天……\n是吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0250","text":"模拟考试……\n……可是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0260","text":"要是又请假不工作的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0270","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0280","text":"不好意思……\n关于幽谷的日程安排……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0290","text":"Producer先生……\n……大家……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0300","text":"我…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0310","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0320","text":"啊————…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0330","text":"雪之下小姐的……\n便签……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0340","text":"『无论什么时候……\n　都是雾子的伙伴……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0350","text":"『什么都……跟我说……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0360","text":"『直到找到答案为止……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0370","text":"『一起……努力吧……────』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0380","text":"制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0390","text":"……嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_02_0400","text":"好的……！"}]
